      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "전장 훈련은 늘 같은 동선이라 좀 지루해요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Field drills are always the same routes, it gets a bit dull.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7f8643f2-fb32-506a-8a5b-8281f07c5f3f",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "23f70dcf-de2b-50ea-a210-97bcdd22d3a0",
      "content": "지루한 게 몸에 배야 실전에서 안 흔들려.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "It has to get dull enough to stick, so you don't waver in a real match.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a8253f98-b8a5-57e1-b866-40f72e962b70",
      "type": "Comment",
