      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "오, 그거 재밌겠네요!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Oh, that sounds fun!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b1621709-a7b0-5152-8631-4c28c2987ad3",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 170.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "알겠어요. 기본부터 확실히 할게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Got it. I'll nail the basics first.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "138fdce7-887a-5d26-a4ed-bf3bf3961328": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7106ca3f-7e37-5aad-8b08-04ee164162a9",
